{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06548","headline":"终南幽居献苏侍郎三首时拜太祝未上 二 · 储光羲","name":"终南幽居献苏侍郎三首时拜太祝未上 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中岁尚微道，始知将谷神。\n抗策还南山，水木自相亲。\n深林开一道，青嶂成四邻。\n平明去采薇，日入行刈薪。\n云归万壑暗，雪罢千崖春。\n始看玄鸟来，已见瑶华新。\n寄言搴芳者，无乃後时人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}